From 7f349d851e374144861e65a1a9a37d7133866e36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:53:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] dt-bindings: clock: add Amlogic S6 PLL clock controller

Add bindings for the PLL clock controller of the Amlogic S6 SoC. As on
S4, the PLLs live in a separate register block (ANACTRL) from the
peripheral clocks.

The controller provides the GP0, HIFI, HIFI1 and MCLK PLLs and the
fixed PLL dividers (fclk_div*). GP1/GP2/fixed PLL and the PLL source
gates are owned by the SCMI firmware, so their IDs are added in
amlogic,s6-scmi-clkc.h for use as clock inputs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
