From 1812f9d25ddab5079b1248e672814642b5314040 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:53:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] dt-bindings: clock: add Amlogic S6 peripherals clock
 controller

Add bindings for the peripherals clock controller (CLKCTRL) of the
Amlogic S6 SoC, following the S4 layout. Parents coming from the PLL
controller and from SCMI are described as clock inputs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
